  - m_Id: 5179654107136
    m_Localized: Confirm selection?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5998185115648
    m_Localized: "You have finished the experiment!\r\nTHANK YOU for participating\r."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5975942721536
    m_Localized: "TASK 3:\r\nAdjust the door opening so that it reaches the\r\nMINIMUM
      OPENING necessary to pass\r\nwithout rotating your shoulders or hips.\r\nTo
      adjust the opening, use the \"A\" and \"B\" buttons on the controller.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5960843227136
    m_Localized: "TASK 2:\r\nSelect the avatar that best matches your\r\nIDEAL BODY
      SHAPE.\r\nTo select, use the \"grasp\" button on the controller.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5935903895552
    m_Localized: "TASK 1:\r\nSelect the avatar that best matches your\r\nCURRENT
      BODY SHAPE.\r\nTo select, use the \"grasp\" button on the controller.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5911274942464
    m_Localized: "Before we start, let's do an exercise.\r\nTry selecting the ball
      or rocket on the table.\r\nTo select, use the \"grasp\" button on the controller.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5882959196160
    m_Localized: "WELCOME!\r\n\r\nYou will be presented with 3 different tasks; before
      each one, we will present you with instructions.\r\n\r\nTo change the scene
      after completing the task, press the \"Yes\" button.\r\n\r\nPress the button
      below to start!\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
